# oracle: fix nve/manifold/rattle on the thylakoid manifold (two grana stacks joined by a bridge; wB LB lB = 5 10 3 as equal-style variables substituted with ${}), examples/PACKAGES/manifold/thylakoid (4001 particles, a sphere of type 2, 20% deleted with delete_atoms random fraction (porosity has been removed from LAMMPS)), 100 steps
# Native reference: LAMMPS b332f28 built with PKG_MANIFOLD (/store/shuvam/software/lammps-build-manifold/lmp; the installed binary has no MANIFOLD)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 6.1e-15, atoms 2.1e-16.
# oracle-examples: PACKAGES/manifold/thylakoid/thylakoid.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           lj
dimension       3
boundary        f f p
pair_style      lj/cut 1.1225
read_data       thylakoid.data
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0
pair_modify     shift yes
region          make_two sphere -29 0 0 6.25
region          everywhere block -25 25 -25 25 -25 25
group           two region make_two
set             group two type 2
group           one type 1
set             group one type 1
delete_atoms    random fraction 0.2 no all everywhere 123
variable        wB equal 5.0
variable        LB equal 10.0
variable        lB equal 3.0
fix             step all nve/manifold/rattle 1e-4 10 thylakoid ${wB} ${LB} ${lB}
thermo_style    custom step atoms pe ke etotal temp
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
run             100
